## Make neo4j a core dependency (fix driver-missing)

Context: Settings Neo4j Test connection kept failing with driver-missing because
``neo4j`` was an optional extra; ``uv sync`` without ``--extra neo4j`` removed it
from ``.venv``, and the running uvicorn worker still held ``_neo4j = None`` from
import time.

Changes:

1. pyproject.toml
   Moved ``neo4j>=5.0`` into core ``[project].dependencies``; removed optional
   ``[neo4j]`` extra.

2. requirements.txt / scripts/setup.sh / README.md
   Dropped ``--extra neo4j`` / ``.[...,neo4j]`` now that the driver is core.

3. uv.lock
   Regenerated via ``uv sync`` so neo4j stays installed by default.

