## Fix graph backend not persisted from Domain → Information

Context: Changing Graph Backend on Domain → Information appeared to work in
the UI but was lost after Save / reload. Root cause was incomplete wiring from
the per-domain backend feature: navbar pre-save omitted `graph_backend`, and
`export_for_save` / `import_from_file` never round-tripped it through UC.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/js/navbar.js
   Include `#domainGraphBackend` in `saveDomainInfoBeforeSave` payload so
   navbar Save persists the selection to session before UC write.

2. src/back/objects/session/DomainSession.py
   Export and import `info.graph_backend` (normalized) so UC save/load keeps
   the per-domain backend.

3. tests/units/domain/test_domain_session.py
   Round-trip + export/import coverage for `graph_backend`.

4. tests/units/domain/test_domain_service.py
   `save_domain_info` coverage for graph backend (incl. normalization).

